      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>USB works again: plug in the phone and Nearside moves to the cable.</li>
<li>If another program (adb, Android Studio) is using the phone's USB connection, the panel says so, and Nearside moves to the cable once it's free.</li>
<li>The launcher (⌥⌘P) opens without a pause.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
